244.           </button>
245.         </h2>
246.         <div class="details hidden">
247.           <p>Cats are champion sleepers, spending 12-16 hours per day sleeping or in a resting state. This is a remnant of their wild ancestry — in the wild, cats conserve energy through extended sleep, allowing them to hunt during peak activity times. Kittens and senior cats may sleep even more, up to 20 hours daily.</p>
248.         </div>
